WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:14.518
Jack and Polly are bouncing toward my barn.

2
00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:23.567
Polly seems very excited about her

3
00:00:23.568 --> 00:00:28.072
ball! Jack: Hello, Omar! We're

4
00:00:28.073 --> 00:00:41.900
here! Where is he?

5
00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:45.352
Polly: I guess he's out.

6
00:00:45.353 --> 00:00:47.579
I can't wait to show him my ball!

7
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:52.512
Catch, Jack! Jack:

8
00:00:52.513 --> 00:00:58.942
Too high, Polly! Be careful. You

9
00:00:58.943 --> 00:01:03.269
could break something. Polly:

10
00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:13.625
It's only a ball. Jack:

11
00:01:13.626 --> 00:01:19.047
Maybe you should put it away. Polly:

12
00:01:19.048 --> 00:01:21.916
I will . . . when Omar gets here!

13
00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:31.057
Omar: Here I am.

14
00:01:31.058 --> 00:01:35.702
Are you ready to work? Polly:

15
00:01:35.703 --> 00:01:37.517
I want to play ball. Omar:

16
00:01:37.518 --> 00:01:38.947
You may.

17
00:01:38.948 --> 00:01:42.131
Polly: Yay!

18
00:01:42.132 --> 00:01:47.008
Omar: After you work.

19
00:01:47.009 --> 00:01:51.393
Please sort these nuts and bolts. Jack:

20
00:01:51.394 --> 00:01:53.445
We can do that. Polly:

21
00:01:53.446 --> 00:02:00.754
Sure. That's easy.

22
00:02:00.755 --> 00:02:12.029
Jack: The air is sparkling!

23
00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:20.273
Look at that big castle over there! Polly:

24
00:02:20.274 --> 00:02:24.301
Wow! Look at my ball! It's gold now!

25
00:02:24.302 --> 00:02:32.960
Catch, Jack! Jack:

26
00:02:32.961 --> 00:02:35.954
It went so far! Polly:

27
00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.703
I need my ball! Jack:

28
00:02:37.704 --> 00:02:42.340
I'll look for it. You wait here.

29
00:02:42.341 --> 00:02:46.938
Polly: Don't take too long, Jack!

